cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "adoption-sim: complex contagion on synthetic organizational networks"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-06-10"
license: AGPL-3.0
authors:
  - name: "adoption-sim project contributors"
abstract: >-
  Research simulator of complex contagion (fractional thresholds with
  ready/willing/able gating and per-source visibility) on synthetic two-layer
  organizational networks. Compares seeding strategies (broadcast, random,
  champions, cluster, line-manager-first) under explicit, ratified modeling
  decisions with logged alternatives. All outputs are synthetic and
  uncalibrated by design (v0.1).
keywords:
  - complex contagion
  - threshold models
  - organizational networks
  - diffusion of innovations
  - agent-based simulation
